# Cloud-Native Fitness Experience — Phase 3

## Overview
Phase 3 introduces intelligent plan generation into the system.

Building on Phase 2 (secure user data ingestion), this phase transforms stored user preferences into personalized workout and meal plans using a serverless architecture.

---

## Architecture
Client → API Gateway → Lambda → DynamoDB

- **API Gateway**: Exposes POST /generate-plan endpoint  
- **Lambda**: Processes user input and generates plans  
- **DynamoDB**: Stores user profile data  

---

## Key Features
- Serverless plan generation using AWS Lambda  
- Structured JSON input/output contract  
- Real-time response via synchronous API design  
- Input validation and error handling  

---

## Challenges & Solutions

**Challenge:** SageMaker added unnecessary complexity  
**Solution:** Pivoted to Lambda for faster deployment and lower cost  

**Challenge:** Input validation  
**Solution:** Added checks for required fields (user_id, profile_data)  

**Challenge:** API deployment inconsistencies  
**Solution:** Implemented Terraform deployment triggers  

---

## Cost & Scalability
- No idle infrastructure  
- Pay-per-request execution  
- Fully serverless architecture  
- Automatically scales with demand  

---

## Outcome
- Personalized workout and meal plan generation  
- Clean API-driven architecture  
- Cost-efficient and scalable design  
- Production-ready Infrastructure as Code  

---

